WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.430
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.430
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:36.280
My name is Kurata Sana, first year
middle school student.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.280
Aoki-Award winning, author, Mama,
the squirrel is Maro-chan.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.830
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.910
Mysterious white bat Babbit.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.540
Hayama, Akito, who does karate, a
passionate lone wolf, my best friend.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.130
Matsui Fuka, best friend I met in
the bathroom with a Western accent.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.800
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.300
Sana-chan.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:00.800
I'll do anything... for you.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.470
I'm here, Sana-chan...

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:08.440
So... please don't cry...
Please don't cry...

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.980
I'm Not the One Who Gets
Turned Down and Cries

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.320
Sana-chan, it's me!
I'm coming in...

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.240
S-Sana-chan?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.120
Huh? Rei-kun...

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.830
Would you like to play a game
to kill some time?

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:27.790
Game?

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.670
Here you go, Sana-chan!
It's a very interesting game.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.630
I'm recently addicted to it!

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.050
Yeah, yeah, you got it!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:37.050
Wow! You're doing great, Sana-chan!
Ah! You need to stop there,

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.510
and go back the other way.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.010
Sana-chan?

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:45.470
Ah! The Black Babbit! No!
You got peed on!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.430
Game over...

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.600
That's too bad. You were only
a bit close to winning!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.150
How much is 'a bit'?
I don't see any chance at all!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.150
- Oh yes! Do you want some popcorn?
- Is it food this time?

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.650
Ah! Idiot.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.740
Then how about this?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.370
What is 'liawaknahcans'
(Etuc Anas)?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:08.250
The answer is... - 'Sana-chan
Kanwaii'(Cute Sana)!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.290
Next question... is...

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.420
Rei-kun?

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.130
What is it, Sana-chan?

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.130
Can you leave me alone for a bit?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.590
Oh, that's right,
your must be tired.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.800
Please rest well tonight!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.840
Goodnight...

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:28.390
Sana-chan looks sad, how am I
supposed to tell her about the production?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:33.230
I see. Sana-chan is heart-broken?

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:37.440
Yes, she doesn't usually get
depressed about little things.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.610
But this time she really lost her spirit.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:46.370
I don't want to see an expressionless Sana in front of the movie camera either.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.620
Yes...

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:53.500
Anyway... we'll have to get going with the
rest of the scenes without Sana.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.080
I truly apologize.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.460
However...

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.880
This is the limit, Sagami-san.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.590
There aren't many scenes left
without her in it.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:07.050
And we also need to prepare for
the shot two days after tomorrow.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.100
I want to be ready by then.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.480
I understand.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.600
She will definitely recover after
one more day of rest.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:20.070
<i>Even so... What method should
I use to cheer her up?</i>

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.400
Oh yeah! Cake attack!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:26.910
Sana-chan! Here's some delicious
cakes, have some and work hard, ok?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.200
How about takoyaki?

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.290
Wait a minute, Rei-kun!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.370
You think that plan would work on
Sana-chan right now?

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.920
Well, no, I didn't think...

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:42.590
I can't even cheer her up!
Why am I so useless?

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:48.220
In such time, I had to call the person who does things the way you least expect.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:53.020
Who's that?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.770
Least expecting...
Who could that be?

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.270
There are too many of them!
I can't figure it out!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.320
What's going on? Everyone seems
to be stressed out.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.690
Remember to shut the door or these
mosquitoes will come to bite you.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.950
Sana-chan, I'll definitely get her here.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.910
Don't tell me she's already in bed!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.500
Sorry, Rei-kun.
I made you worry about me.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.500
It's all my fault.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:24.800
Want to forget all about Hayama
as soon as possible...

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.800
I know I have to go back to normal
as soon as possible...

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.770
...but, I just can't get it
out of my head.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.940
Start moving them!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.520
What should I do with the sheets?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.690
Just get it in there.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.690
Okay, here we go!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.280
Did you hear some noise?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.950
That... that's a helicopter!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.830
I think it's coming this way!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.160
Ah... It is coming closer.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.220
Something is falling down.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.680
Is it going to just land here?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.270
H-How very unexpected...

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.940
Ooh! It's Kurata-san!

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:27.150
Hello! Nice to meet you all.
I am Sana's mother.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.610
Thank you for taking care of her.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:33.120
I heard that she's having some
trouble, so I came right away.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.790
Who would have expected...

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.330
Over there are presents
I've brought. Please try some.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.380
Wow! There's even shellfish!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.500
And eels, too!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.460
What a fantastic present, Sensei.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:48.510
Do you realize that they're energizing supplements? I hope you like them.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.430
Sensei...!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:53.140
Ah, Sagami! Long time no see.
Thanks for your phone call.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.220
Oh! I'm so glad! I'm so glad!
I'm so glad you're here!

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.480
Only you can save Sana-chan now!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.810
Sensei...

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.560
Onda-san, what's the matter?

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.360
I... I have a fear of heights.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:09.700
Sensei, please don't forget!
The deadline is tomorrow!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.320
Let... go... of... me.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.950
You shouldn't have come.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.700
Go and bring Sana's stuff down!

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.120
Let's go, Sagami!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:22.170
Yes! I'm sorry, Onda-san,
it's all because of me.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.460
Sana-chan... I have invited
a wonderful guest!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.760
Rei-kun, I don't feel like seeing
anyone at this moment!

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:30.720
Mama!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.180
Yaho!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.050
Mama... Mama!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.770
It's ok. Sagami has already
told me all about it.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.520
How's your leg?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.940
It's better now.
It doesn't hurt anymore.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.020
Good. I'm glad.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.820
But... I can't hold
myself together anymore!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.900
I can't concentrate on work!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:55.160
I've already taken so many days off...

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:59.330
...and given everybody so...
so much trouble.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.500
Because of the Hayama incident.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.870
Hmm... I've heard about it...

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.170
The thing about Hayama is still
'banging around' my head.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.840
- You mean 'hanging around'...
- I know that I must forget quickly

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:13.840
and Naozumi confessed to me...

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.850
Everything's such a mess!

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.430
You stupid idiot!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.720
Sensei!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.480
Mama... what are you doing to
your precious daughter?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.190
Because you want to escape,
that's why!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.900
It's not good to do so, if you
have worries, then worry all the way!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.480
But how am I supposed to work
if I don't forget them?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.490
My head is so messed up... Ah!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.900
Can't work... Ah!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:36.410
Mama, you don't know anything
about my feelings!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.240
Come to think of it, I don't.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.370
Sensei!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.960
The blame goes to you, Sagami!
You did not clarify anything at all last night!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.750
Sensei, it's a really bad
situation for Sana-chan!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.380
Hayama is going out with
another girl. Stop it!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:55.380
Naozumi comforted her,
but Sana-chan is still depressed.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.300
Are you listening, Sensei?

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.890
What in the world?

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:05.390
I thought Sagami was in love with monkey and so did Hayama-kun and Naozumi-kun.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:09.400
But that's not important.
Here's a gift from Shimura-san.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.940
From Shimura-san?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.030
Please take a look.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.950
Wow! There's mini-octopus,
sausage, and tempura prawns!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.920
Mm... These are so good,
Shimura-san.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.710
And this is from your mother.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.500
Whenever I have problems, I write
them down to release the stress.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.550
In here?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:37.090
The harder you try to forget, the more the problems get stuck in your head and...

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.640
you can't forget it!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:44.350
That's why you need to face them
and stand up to them.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.600
Face the worries?

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.690
Worry to the maximum.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:53.070
Use your own ability to turn the
worries into strengths.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.650
Turn them into your own strengths?

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.780
But I don't have any.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.240
Yes, you do.
Because you are my child.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.580
You are only a little scared now.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:07.210
Someday you'll laugh at yourself
for being so worried about such small thing.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.000
Eh? But I'm so hurt right now.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.250
Stop mumbling and start writing!

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.260
love

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.390
Ah! This is
too embarrassing!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.520
Shush!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:26.230
Keep it to yourself!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.020
Isn't Sensei a little
over excited today?

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.900
The best way is to be pushy.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.530
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.540
Naozumi-kun likes me.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:53.340
I... I am in love with Hayama.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.880
But, Hayama is going out with Fuka.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.340
Hayama and I...

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.060
But I...

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:13.230
I'm still in love with him.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.190
I've written this much,
but I still like him.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.030
Even if he is going out
with Fuka...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.200
I still love Hayama.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.700
I see. I don't need to
change anything.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.500
If I can't change my feelings
no matter what,

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.040
I should just let it go naturally.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.380
Say, Mama, I...

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.630
Huh? Mountains of trash!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.460
I think I'm fine now...

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.880
I'll let it go naturally.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.930
Is that really okay with you?

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.010
You must be very careful now,
or everything's going to come back to weeds.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.390
What is 'A-N-A-B-O'?

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.390
{parte b}

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.230
That is, 'Obana!'

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.330
It's been a long time I don't
wake up feeling good!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:12.160
But my hip really hurts!
Ow... it aches!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.710
That hurts!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.750
Mama!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:19.170
You sat on my leg and it hurt! It was such a nice sleep.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.930
Nice time sleeping?
Mama, did you complete your manuscripts?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.850
Of course not, I fell asleep!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.310
But Onda-san has been waiting for
them for a long time, right?

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:34.270
Sana, there are many misfortunes
in one's life.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:38.150
And I must teach that philosophy
to my amiable Onda.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:42.320
So I have decided to doze off a bit
more. Good night again!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:46.950
Ah! Mama, wait a minute! If you
don't finish I'll feel so bad for Onda-san!

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:52.160
Mm... What's the poor Onda-san
doing now? Let's go see for ourselves!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.670
Did Onda-san stay up all night?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:01.710
How can I go to bed with Sensei
staying up trying to figure out her story?

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.090
He sounds like an example
of a good editor.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:07.590
In contrast that Sensei
is nothing like him.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.930
I'm going off for a little walk, Mama.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.770
Huh. I can't do it.
Not even this morning.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.780
Good morning, Naozumi-kun!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.490
That scared me!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.150
Sana-chan, good morning!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.910
You seem to be up for some fun,
Naozumi-kun!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.410
Giving the sun a good morning.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.580
You seem to be pretty cheerful.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.830
Just like what my mother said.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.210
I feel relaxed
after being extremely worried.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.880
I'm so uncomplicated!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.000
Sana-chan!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:44.760
I think it should be fine if
I just let it go naturally.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:49.090
About Hayama... it's not like
I want to date him...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.890
I thought this is okay...

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.680
Just to think about him.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.690
I'm not going to ask for anything in return.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.270
I think... this'll be a little
hard on you...

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.110
Mm. But I'll give it a try!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.280
Is that so?

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.280
Say, Naozumi-kun,

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:10.620
I'm very happy that you
confessed to me. Thank you.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.120
Sana-chan.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.910
But I think I will only be able to
date the one that I truly love.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.670
I'm sorry, Naozumi-kun.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:23.420
Not that
I didn't expect that.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.090
I'm gonna learn from you.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.680
As in not asking for
anything in return.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.980
Morning! Do your best today!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.610
Ah! It's already this late.
Let's go back!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.440
I'm back on track today.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.900
Oh, really?

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.280
Mmm. I've taken three days off.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.540
Well, see you later!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.120
Good morning, Sensei!

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.580
This is Onda. I'm here to get
the manuscript!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.000
Excuse me!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.420
Yo! Sorry you had to do this.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.460
This many?! Sensei!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.930
You worked so hard on this!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.550
I'm so touched!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.560
- Please give it to me.
- Onda-san...

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:17.810
Sensei, this person trusts you.
Look, he's waiting for you in tears!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.390
Onda, you need to protect these
manuscripts really well.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.390
Is it really?

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.100
Yes, thank you very much!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.360
- Well, I leave the rest with you!
- Sensei...

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:28.240
Hey, it's a good idea
to check up on the contents...

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:31.660
What is this?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.780
Look, these are
all portrayed by Sana-chan.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.370
Sensei is too mean!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.830
Mail.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.830
Sorry, Onda,
please clean up this mess.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:51.550
Onda says, 'I'm too naive to have trusted Sensei.'

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.050
This week's Sana-chan!

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.100
I feel like
a talented cartoon artist!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.430
Is that so?

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.560
Mama.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.690
Let's go for a walk.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:06.230
W-Walk? But I just
came back from one.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.400
Sky walk?

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.530
Wow! Really nothing can compare
to heights, I feel so good!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.910
If you want to leave, I can take
you home right way in this.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:17.990
How about that?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.330
You don't need to force yourself.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:28.000
No need to lie to yourself and
oppose your feelings just for work.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.510
You are only a junior high school student.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:34.640
There's my cabin.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.050
I can also see Rei-kun and
Naozumi-kun's cabins too.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.180
Ah! That forest!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.600
We were shooting over there
the first day.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.730
Feels like a long time ago.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:51.690
It's Naozumi-kun!
He is still playing his trumpet.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.660
Oy! Naozumi-kun!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.410
Is that Sana-chan?

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.870
Are they in the middle
of shooting over there?

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.620
That's right.
It's Asako-san's scene.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.830
- Isn't that Sensei and Sana-chan?
- Are they headed this way?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.290
They're waving!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.000
Hey! Rei-kun!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.340
Not that! They're telling you
not to interrupt the shooting!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:15.760
Hey! You're interfering with our shoot.
Get away, quick! So how can I go on?

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.760
I would sacrifice my life this
production!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.640
Sorry about that!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.640
They got mad, since everybody's
working so hard.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.850
That's right,
they spent so much energy.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.110
Ah! I see the mansion!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:31.610
Oh, is that it? What a marvelous
building.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.110
Ah! Sana, what are those people
doing over there?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.200
Preparing for tomorrow's act.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:41.700
Everyone contributed so much into
this movie for me.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:47.250
For the sake of the audience,
people are united as a team.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.630
A movie comes from
many people's hard work.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.800
A lot of people even spent many
months just to work on this.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:56.720
The mansion that everybody built
is going to be burned down tomorrow.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.680
What?

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.140
What did you say? You mean
there's a scene of you walking out of the fire?

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.520
Why didn't you ever mention it to me?!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.310
It's dangerous!
We're in the middle of a flight!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.060
Something is wrong with
Sensei's helicopter.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.440
Can it be a break down?

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.230
Mama! Calm down.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.440
Don't worry.

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:16.820
There will be plenty of fire trucks,
and there's no fire in my scene.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:19.200
Everyone is only preparing.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.240
- ubuojiad
- 'daijoubu' (no problem)

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.580
Sensei! Sana-chan!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.880
I'm back.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:33.380
Sana-chan, are you alright?
I was worried!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:38.510
Please don't scare me. I thought
you were taking Sana-chan home.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.550
Yeah, I was planning to do it.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.140
I'll tell you something.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:48.810
If something happens to Sana-chan,
I'll let you try sky diving without a parachute!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.940
Are you alright, Sana-chan?
We were scared!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.900
Oh, it was nothing,
only a bit shaking.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.320
But, everything's fine now.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:19:00.700
That's right. It's not a time to
worry and cause everyone trouble.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:04.990
Now I need to concentrate on
completing this movie.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.700
Director!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.460
I'll work, I will give it my best.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.670
It's great! Sana-chan seems to
have regained all her energy.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.970
To catch up with the scenes that
have been pushed back for me,

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.220
I started filming that afternoon.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.180
Feels like a different world,
doesn't it?

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:31.100
I wish I can forget about the
deadline and keep watching this.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.480
Sensei seems to
have a shameful heart ache.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:36.570
I think it's about time to go
back, right, Onda?

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.490
Really, Sensei?

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.320
Alright, smile, the both of you.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.740
I'll take a picture now.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.870
Flight Maru-chan

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.660
Mama is going back.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.120
Sana, do your best!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.040
Okay.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.920
Sagami! If anything happens
you'll be responsible!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.840
See you, Mama!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.670
Good luck with your writing!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.510
Roger, leave it to me!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.260
Do you think there'll
be no problem?

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.220
Mama, thank you. I'll work hard.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:10.640
It has finally come to
the last scene.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.480
Re-check the automatic sprinklers.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.940
Sprinklers are working fine.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.830
Hello? Hello? Okay, they work.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:31.040
Listen, Sana-chan. If there's
an emergency, use this to call help!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.540
I'll go rescue you within
three seconds.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:37.130
I know, Rei-kun. Don't worry about
me, nothing's going to go wrong.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:42.720
Though they say they use inflammable materials there's always chance of risk.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.550
Sana-chan. It's about time
to get started!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.720
Gotcha!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.260
Just this time...

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:51.390
everything has to go as planned,
definitely no second chance.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.560
Okay!

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.310
Stand by here, right?

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.650
Listen carefully, Sana-chan.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.190
This is the signal to come out.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.440
When the fire spreads about right,
I will press the sound.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.200
There shouldn't be fire or smoke
in the hallway,

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:07.870
but temperature is still going to
go up. Be prepared for that.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.660
No problem! Extinct the fame in
one's art to cruel the friar.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.870
Extinct... fame? What's that?

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.420
'Extinguish the flame in one's
heart to cool the fire.' Is the correct answer.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.420
The meaning? Look it up in
the dictionary yourself!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.090
Sana-chan is ready on stand by!

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.380
Well, I'll get going.
Take care.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.260
Oh God! Oh Almighty Buddha!
Please protect Sana-chan!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.680
Naozumi is also ready.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:31.350
If the mansion gets burned down,
there is no chance to recover it.

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.270
I definitely can't fail this.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:34.940
Okay, c'mon!

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:41.360
Scene 92. Everyone, be serious and
careful in what you're doing.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:43.690
Start!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.830
